{"t": 1791685019.557856, "event": "supplier_reply", "case": "case:P18", "supplier": "sup:70740", "message": {"thread_id": "thread:P18:70740", "message_id": "msg:70740-1-2", "in_reply_to": null, "from": "sales@70740", "from_name": "Inside Sales, Blankstahl Werdenfels GmbH", "to": "Hollerau Pumpenwerke GmbH", "subject": "Re: Alloy surcharge and base price for 1.4404 bar (Werdenfels)", "body": "Dear customer,\n\nWe have reviewed your offer and can adjust our Angebot as follows. We checked the volume change data you cited; it holds and we took it into account. We welcome your commitment to a 24-month volume, which allows us to optimize our planning. However, for a contract of this duration, we must include the AS-14404 index clause to account for raw material fluctuations. \n\nIncorporating your requested 90-day payment terms, we can offer a revised price of €5.70 per unit. Our current Angebot features a price of €5.70 per unit, Zahlungsziel 90 days net, a contract term of 24 months, and a Preisgleitklausel on AS-14404. We can offer a Preisgleitklausel on AS-14404, AS-14404, AS-14404. Our standard terms apply to everything the quote does not state; see attached. \n\nA binding higher volume would help us and can improve the price. Which volume can you commit to? Please note that our offer stays valid for 30 days.\n\nMit freundlichen Grüßen\nFranz Seidl\nInside Sales, Blankstahl Werdenfels GmbH", "attachments": [{"attachment_id": "att:70740-1-quote", "name": "quote-offer-70740-1.pdf", "type": "pdf", "content_b64": null}], "term_sheets": [{"term_sheet_id": "offer:70740-1", "terms": {"unit_price": 5.7, "payment_days": 90, "index_clause": {"series": "AS-14404", "material_share": 0.45, "deadband_pct": 0.0, "base_month": "2026-08"}, "contract_months": 24}}], "refs": [], "action": null, "status": "open", "signals": {"reply_delay_days": 2, "validity_days": 30}, "missing_fields": [], "claim_results": [{"index": 0, "result": "verified"}]}}
