{"t": 1791685020.575218, "event": "supplier_reply", "case": "case:P18", "supplier": "sup:70740", "message": {"thread_id": "thread:P18:70740", "message_id": "msg:70740-2-4", "in_reply_to": null, "from": "sales@70740", "from_name": "Inside Sales, Blankstahl Werdenfels GmbH", "to": "Hollerau Pumpenwerke GmbH", "subject": "Re: Alloy surcharge and base price for 1.4404 bar (Werdenfels)", "body": "Dear customer,\n\nWe have reviewed your offer and can adjust our Angebot as follows. We checked the price history data you cited; it holds, but it does not change our calculation. Our price follows our main cost drivers: AS-14404, PPI-C2431, LCI-C. As we cannot offer a fixed price over a 24-month period, the AS-14404 index clause remains necessary to manage volatility. We can offer a Preisgleitklausel on AS-14404, AS-14404, AS-14404.\n\nIn response to your movement, we are pleased to lower our offer to €5.60 per unit for this package. Alternatively, with a Preisgleitklausel on AS-14404: €5.60 per unit. \n\nOtherwise, we can offer a price of €5.50 per unit, Zahlungsziel 90 days net, a contract term of 24 months, a Preisgleitklausel on AS-14404. Please note that this offer remains valid for 30 days. We always strive to give you the best support from our extensive range!\n\nMit freundlichen Grüßen\nFranz Seidl\nInside Sales, Blankstahl Werdenfels GmbH", "attachments": [], "term_sheets": [{"term_sheet_id": "offer:70740-2", "terms": {"unit_price": 5.5, "payment_days": 90, "index_clause": {"series": "AS-14404", "material_share": 0.45, "deadband_pct": 0.0, "base_month": "2026-08"}, "contract_months": 24}}, {"term_sheet_id": "offer:70740-2-a", "terms": {"unit_price": 5.6, "payment_days": 90, "index_clause": {"series": "AS-14404", "material_share": 0.45, "deadband_pct": 5.0, "base_month": "2026-08"}, "contract_months": 24}}], "refs": [], "action": null, "status": "open", "signals": {"reply_delay_days": 2, "validity_days": 30}, "missing_fields": [], "claim_results": [{"index": 0, "result": "verified"}]}}
