{"t": 1791685021.051723, "event": "supplier_reply", "case": "case:P18", "supplier": "sup:70740", "message": {"thread_id": "thread:P18:70740", "message_id": "msg:70740-3-6", "in_reply_to": null, "from": "sales@70740", "from_name": "Inside Sales, Blankstahl Werdenfels GmbH", "to": "Hollerau Pumpenwerke GmbH", "subject": "Re: Alloy surcharge and base price for 1.4404 bar (Werdenfels)", "body": "Dear customer,\n\nWe have reviewed your offer and can adjust our Angebot as follows. We have verified the index drop you cited and have adjusted our calculation accordingly. However, as previously stated, we cannot offer a fixed price for a 24-month contract, making the AS-14404 index clause mandatory. In response to your movement and the index data, we are pleased to lower our price to €5.40 per unit with the index clause included.\n\nOur price follows our main cost drivers: AS-14404, PPI-C2431, LCI-C. AS-14404 rose 5.9 % in twelve months and is 45 % of our cost. That remains. LCI-C rose 2.7 % in twelve months and is 5 % of our cost. That remains. PPI-C2431 rose 12.3 % in twelve months and is 38 % of our cost. That remains.\n\nOur current Angebot stands at a price of €5.30 per unit, Zahlungsziel 90 days net, a contract term of 24 months, a Preisgleitklausel on AS-14404. \n\nAlternatively, with a Preisgleitklausel on AS-14404: a price of €5.40 per unit, Zahlungsziel 90 days net, a contract term of 24 months, a Preisgleitklausel on AS-14404. This offer remains valid for 30 days.\n\nMit freundlichen Grüßen\nFranz Seidl\nInside Sales, Blankstahl Werdenfels GmbH", "attachments": [], "term_sheets": [{"term_sheet_id": "offer:70740-3", "terms": {"unit_price": 5.3, "payment_days": 90, "index_clause": {"series": "AS-14404", "material_share": 0.45, "deadband_pct": 0.0, "base_month": "2026-08"}, "contract_months": 24}}, {"term_sheet_id": "offer:70740-3-a", "terms": {"unit_price": 5.4, "payment_days": 90, "index_clause": {"series": "AS-14404", "material_share": 0.45, "deadband_pct": 5.0, "base_month": "2026-08"}, "contract_months": 24}}], "refs": [], "action": null, "status": "open", "signals": {"reply_delay_days": 2, "validity_days": 30}, "missing_fields": [], "claim_results": [{"index": 0, "result": "verified"}]}}
